  "rulesText": "When Caradora enters, you may search your library for a Mount or Vehicle card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\nIf one or more +1/+1 counters would be put on a creature or Vehicle you control, that many plus one +1/+1 counters are put on it instead.",
